 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 75,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Dust storm season:** In north-west India (Rajasthan), dust storms are most common in the hot, dry pre-monsoon summer months (April to June)."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 76,
   "sec": 9,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Bichhri case:** Bichhri village is near Udaipur in **Rajasthan**, where chemical units dumped H-acid sludge (ICELA, 1996)."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 77,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Alembic (2020):** the Supreme Court also quashed the **2002 MoEF circular** that had allowed ex post facto clearance."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 77,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Vanashakti recall:** the May 2025 ruling had struck down the **2017 Notification** and the **2021 Office Memorandum**; the November 2025 recall (2:1) noted about **Rs 20,000 crore** of projects at stake and relied on the **D. Swamy** and **Pahwa Plastics** judgments."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 77,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Objective of NGT:** effective and speedy disposal of cases on environmental protection and conservation of forests and other natural resources, including relief and compensation for damage."
  }
